Wed Oct 28 06:40:00 UTC 2026 - abdullah mardini <superppl@gmail.com>

- Initial package: bc250_memory KMP from Hexxeh/bc250-memory-dkms
  de4740c, GDDR6 VRAM temperature hwmon driver for the BC-250
- No autoload (no module alias); modprobe.d sets auto_patch=0 so a
  plain load is inert. Requires an SMU-unlocked BIOS (or a prior
  runtime unlock) and manual coordination with the GPU governor.
